{"unit_id":2,"stage_id":2,"lesson":{"lesson_id":4,"lesson_key":"S2L4","stage_id":2,"title":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Alaa' (Par): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Alaa' (Par): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ","en":"Preposition 'Alaa' (On / Upon): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ","ur":"حرفِ جر 'عَلَىٰ' (پر): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ","hi":"हर्फ़-ए-जर्र 'अला' (पर): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ"},"arabic_Focus":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْعَرْشُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ ، عَلَى الْعَرْشِ","hinglish_Focus":"Kitaab, Arsh → Kitaab par, Arsh par","page_numbers":"58–59","book_page":58,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْعَرْشُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ ، عَلَى الْعَرْشِ","hinglish":"Kitaab, Arsh → Kitaab par, Arsh par","arabic_word":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْعَرْشُ","arabic_combined":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْعَرْشُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ ، عَلَى الْعَرْشِ","hinglish_word":"Kitaab, Arsh","hinglish_combined":"Kitaab, Arsh → Kitaab par, Arsh par","title_en":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Alaa' (Par): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ","subtitle":"Unit 2 • Lesson 4 (Book Page 58–59)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْعَرْشُ","after_ar":"عَلَى الْكِتَابِ ، عَلَى الْعَرْشِ","before_hi":"Kitaab, Arsh","after_hi":"Kitaab par, Arsh par"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S2L4 — Harf-e-Jarr 'Alaa' (Par): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S2L4 — Harf-e-Jarr 'Alaa' (Par): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qaa'ida / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["عَلَىٰ + الْـ (Zair ـِ)","عَلَى الْكِتَابِ / عَلَى الْعَرْشِ / عَلَى النَّبِيِّ","Kitaab par / Arsh par / Nabi par"],["عَلَىٰ + Nakirah (Do Zair ـٍ)","عَلَىٰ هُدًى / عَلَىٰ بَيِّنَةٍ / عَلَىٰ صِرَاطٍ","Hidayat par / Roshan daleel par / Ek raaste par"],["لَعَلَىٰ (Yaqeenan ... par)","وَإِنَّكَ لَعَلَىٰ خُلُقٍ عَظِيمٍ","Aur beshak aap bade azeem akhlaaq par fa'iz hain"]]}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 4</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr 'Alaa' (Par): الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ (Page 58–59)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، الْعَرْشُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr (عَلَىٰ + ـِ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">عَلَى الْكِتَابِ ، عَلَى الْعَرْشِ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، الْعَرْشُ (Kitaab, Arsh) se عَلَى الْكِتَابِ ، عَلَى الْعَرْشِ (Kitaab par, Arsh par) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 58–59):** **`عَلَىٰ`** ka matlab **'par'** hai. Iske baad aane wale ism ke neeche **Zair (`ـِ / ـٍ`)** aati hai: `الْكِتَابُ ← عَلَى الْكِتَابِ` (Kitaab par), `سَلَامٌ عَلَىٰ نُوحٍ` (Salaam ho Nuh A.S. par)."}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Column 1 aur Column 2 ka farq ghour se dekhiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Upar di gayi misaalon se wazeh hai ke (عَلَى) ka matlab \"par\" hai, aur iske baad aane wale lafz par zair (kasrah) aati hai. (عَلَى) aur iske baad wala lafz milkar ek phrase banaate hain jinka tarjuma milaakar hota hai."}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Neeche di gayi Qur'ani ibaarat khud samjhein aur tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_g5","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l4_g5_w1","arabic":"عَلَى النَّبِيِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّبِيِّ</span>","hinglish":"Nabi par","translations":{"en":"Upon the Prophet","ur":"نبی پر","hi":"नबी पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w2","arabic":"عَلَى الرَّسُولِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّسُولِ</span>","hinglish":"Rasool par","translations":{"en":"Upon the Messenger","ur":"رسول پر","hi":"रसूल पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w3","arabic":"عَلَى الرَّحْمَنِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّحْمَنِ</span>","hinglish":"Rahman par","translations":{"en":"Upon the Most Merciful (Ar-Rahman)","ur":"رحمن پر","hi":"रहमान पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w4","arabic":"عَلَى اللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Allah par","translations":{"en":"Upon Allah","ur":"اللہ پر","hi":"अल्लाह पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w5","arabic":"عَلَى النَّاسِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّاسِ</span>","hinglish":"Logon par","translations":{"en":"Upon mankind / people","ur":"لوگوں پر","hi":"लोगों पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w6","arabic":"عَلَى الْعَرْشِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَرْشِ</span>","hinglish":"Arsh par","translations":{"en":"Over the Throne","ur":"عرش پر","hi":"अर्श पर / सिंहासन पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w7","arabic":"عَلَى الْأَرْضِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَرْضِ</span>","hinglish":"Zameen par","translations":{"en":"Upon the earth","ur":"زمین پر","hi":"ज़मीन पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w8","arabic":"عَلَى الْغَيْبِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْغَيْبِ</span>","hinglish":"Ghaib par","translations":{"en":"Upon the unseen","ur":"غیب پر","hi":"ग़ैब पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w9","arabic":"عَلَى الْآخِرَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْآخِرَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Aakhirat par","translations":{"en":"Upon the Hereafter","ur":"آخرت پر","hi":"आख़िरत पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w10","arabic":"عَلَى الْإِنْسَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِنْسَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Insaan par","translations":{"en":"Upon mankind / man","ur":"انسان پر","hi":"इंसान पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w11","arabic":"عَلَى الْبَاطِلِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَاطِلِ</span>","hinglish":"Baatil par","translations":{"en":"Upon falsehood","ur":"باطل پر","hi":"बातिल पर / असत्य पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g5_w12","arabic":"عَلَى الْحَقِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=