र याक़ूब (अलैहिमुस्सलाम) पर"},"ref":"3:84"}]}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_r8","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Agar (عَلَى) ke baad 'Al' (الـ) na ho toh matlab \"kisi\" ya \"ek\" ke saath hota hai. Pehli misaal dekh kar neeche diye gaye Qur'ani jumlon ka tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_g9","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l4_g9_w1","arabic":"عَلَى خَوْفٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَوْفٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi khauf par","translations":{"en":"Upon fear / In fear","ur":"کسی خوف پر","hi":"किसी ख़ौफ़ पर / किसी डर पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w2","arabic":"عَلَى غَضَبٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَضَبٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi gusse par","translations":{"en":"Upon wrath / anger","ur":"کسی غضب پر / غصے پر","hi":"किसी ग़ज़ब पर / ग़ुस्से पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w3","arabic":"عَلَى قَوْمٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi qaum par","translations":{"en":"Upon a people / nation","ur":"کسی قوم پر","hi":"किसी क़ौम पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w4","arabic":"عَلَى نُورٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نُورٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi roshni par","translations":{"en":"Upon a light","ur":"کسی نور پر / روشنی پر","hi":"किसी नूर पर / रौशनी पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w5","arabic":"عَلَى بَيِّنَةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيِّنَةٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi wazeh daleel par","translations":{"en":"Upon clear evidence","ur":"کسی واضح دلیل پر","hi":"किसी स्पष्ट प्रमाण पर / खुली दलील पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w6","arabic":"عَلَى شَرِيعَةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَرِيعَةٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi shariat par","translations":{"en":"Upon a prescribed law / way","ur":"کسی شریعت پر / راستے پر","hi":"किसी शरीअत पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w7","arabic":"عَلَى هُدًى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُدًى</span>","hinglish":"Kisi hidayat par","translations":{"en":"Upon guidance","ur":"کسی ہدایت پر","hi":"किसी हिदायत पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w8","arabic":"عَلَى عِلْمٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi ilm par","translations":{"en":"Upon knowledge","ur":"کسی علم پر","hi":"किसी इल्म पर / ज्ञान पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w9","arabic":"عَلَى قَرْيَةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَرْيَةٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi basti par","translations":{"en":"Upon a town / village","ur":"کسی بستی پر","hi":"किसी बस्ती पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w10","arabic":"عَلَى سَفَرٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَفَرٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi safar par","translations":{"en":"On a journey","ur":"کسی سفر پر","hi":"किसी सफ़र पर / यात्रा पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w11","arabic":"عَلَى حَيَاةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَيَاةٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi zindagi par","translations":{"en":"For a life (eager for life)","ur":"کسی زندگی پر","hi":"किसी ज़िंदगी पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w12","arabic":"عَلَى تِجَارَةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تِجَارَةٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi tijarat par","translations":{"en":"Upon a trade / commerce","ur":"کسی تجارت پر","hi":"किसी तिजारत पर / व्यापार पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w13","arabic":"عَلَى جَبَلٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَبَلٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi pahaad par","translations":{"en":"Upon a mountain","ur":"کسی پہاڑ پر","hi":"किसी पहाड़ पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w14","arabic":"عَلَى أَمْرٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَمْرٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi hukm par","translations":{"en":"Over an affair / command","ur":"کسی معاملے پر / حکم پر","hi":"किसी मामले पर / हुक्म पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w15","arabic":"عَلَى رَجُلٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَجُلٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi mard par","translations":{"en":"Upon a man","ur":"کسی آدمی پر / مرد پر","hi":"किसी आदमी पर / मर्द पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w16","arabic":"عَلَى أُمَّةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أُمَّةٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi ummat par","translations":{"en":"Upon a nation / community","ur":"کسی امت پر / قوم پر","hi":"किसी उम्मत पर / समुदाय पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w17","arabic":"عَلَى طَعَامٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">طَعَامٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi khane par","translations":{"en":"Upon the food / feeding","ur":"کسی کھانے پر","hi":"किसी खाने पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w18","arabic":"عَلَى أَحَدٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَحَدٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi ek par","translations":{"en":"Upon anyone","ur":"کسی ایک پر","hi":"किसी एक पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w19","arabic":"عَلَى شَيْءٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيْءٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi cheez par","translations":{"en":"Upon anything / something","ur":"کسی چیز پر","hi":"किसी चीज़ पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g9_w20","arabic":"عَلَى بَشَرٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَشَرٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi insaan par","translations":{"en":"Upon a mortal / human being","ur":"کسی انسان پر / بشر پر","hi":"किसी इंसान पर / बशर पर"}}],"cols":4}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_r10","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Kabhi kabhi 'Lam' (لَـ) 'Alaa' (عَلَى) ke shuru mein lagta hai jo iss phrase aur matlab dono par zor deta hai (ta'keed paida karta hai). Khud samajh kar tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_g11","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l4_g11_w1","arabic":"لَعَلَى خُلُقٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَعَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خُلُقٍ</span>","hinglish":"Yaqeenan aala ikhlaq par","translations":{"en":"Truly upon great character","ur":"یقیناً اعلیٰ اخلاق پر","hi":"यक़ीनन उच्च चरित्र पर / आला अख़लाक़ पर"}},{"id":"s2l4_g11_w2","arabic":"لَعَلَى هُدًى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَعَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُدًى</span>","hinglish":"Yaqeenan hidayat par","translations":{"en":"Truly upon guidance","ur":"یقیناً ہدایت پر","hi":"यक़ीनन हिदायत पर"}}]}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_g12","type":"grace_box","data":{"text":"Alhamdulillah, pichle sabqon aur iss dars ki madad se aap neeche diye gaye Qur'ani jumlon ko aasaani se samjhne ke qabil hain. mein jumlon ka tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_v13","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l4_v13_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"سَلَامٌ/ عَلَى نُوحٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سَلَامٌ</span>/ <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نُوحٍ</span>","hinglish":"Salam ho Nooh (A.S.) par","translations":{"ur":"سلام ہو نوح علیہ السلام پر","en":"Peace upon Noah","hi":"सलाम हो नूह (अ.स.) पर"},"ref":"37:79"},{"id":"s2l4_v13_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"سَلَامٌ/ عَلَى إِبْرَاهِيمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سَلَامٌ</span>/ <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْرَاهِيمَ</span>","hinglish":"Salam ho Ibrahim (A.S.) par","translations":{"ur":"سلام ہو ابراہیم علیہ السلام پر","en":"Peace upon Abraham","hi":"सलाम हो इब्राहीम (अ.स.) पर"},"ref":"37:109"},{"id":"s2l4_v13_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"سَلَامٌ/ عَلَى إِلْ يَاسِينَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سَلَامٌ</span>/ <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَاس</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ِينَ</span>","hinglish":"Salam ho Ilyas (A.S.) par","translations":{"ur":"سلام ہو الیاس علیہ السلام پر","en":"Peace upon Elias","hi":"सलाम हो इल्यास (अ.स.) पर"},"ref":"37:130"},{"id":"s2l4_v13_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"سَلَامٌ/ عَلَى مُوسَى وَهَارُونَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سَلَامٌ</span>/ <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُوسَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَهَار</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُونَ</span>","hinglish":"Salam ho Musa (A.S.) aur Haroon (A.S.) par","translations":{"ur":"سلام ہو موسیٰ علیہ السلام اور ہارون علیہ السلام پر","en":"Peace upon Moses and Aaron","hi":"सलाम हो मूसा (अ.स.) और हारून (अ.स.) पर"},"ref":"37:120"},{"id":"s2l4_v13_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"إِنَّ ذَلِكَ/ عَلَى اللَّهِ يَسِيرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">ذَلِكَ</span>/ <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَسِيرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak yeh Allah par aasan hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک یہ اللہ پر آسان ہے","en":"Indeed, that is easy for Allah","hi":"बेशक यह अल्लाह पर आसान है"},"ref":"22:70"},{"id":"s2l4_v13_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"لَيْسَ/ عَلَى الْأَعْمَى/ حَرَجٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَيْسَ</span>/ <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَعْمَى</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَرَجٌ</span>","hinglish":"Andhe par koi tangi nahi hai","translations":{"ur":"اندھے پر کوئی تنگی نہیں ہے","en":"There is no restriction upon the blind","hi":"अंधे पर कोई तंगी नहीं है"},"ref":"24:61"},{"id":"s2l4_v13_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"لَيْسَ عَلَى الْأَعْمَى حَرَجٌ وَلَا عَلَى الْأَعْرَجِ حَرَجٌ وَلَا عَلَى الْمَرِيضِ حَرَجٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَيْسَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَعْمَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَرَجٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَعْرَجِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَرَجٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مَرِيضِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَرَجٌ</span>","hinglish":"Andhe par koi tangi nahi hai, na langde par koi tangi hai, aur na bimaar par koi tangi hai","translations":{"ur":"اندھے پر کوئی تنگی نہیں ہے، نہ لنگڑے پر کوئی تنگی ہے، اور نہ بیمار پر کوئی تنگی ہے","en":"There is no restriction upon the blind, nor upon the lame, nor upon the ill","hi":"अंधे पर कोई तंगी नहीं है, न लंगड़े पर कोई तंगी है, और न बीमार पर कोई तंगी है"},"ref":"24:61"}]}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_lbl14","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise"}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_r15","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Q-1: Neeche di gayi Qur'ani ayaat mein sirf us hisse par ghaur karo jahan 'Alaa' (عَلَى) aur iske baad wala lafz milkar ek phrase banaate hain jisko aap samajh sakte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l4_v16","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l4_v16_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"إِذْ وُقِفُوا عَلَى النَّارِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِذْ وُقِفُوا عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّارِ</span>","hinglish":"Jab woh aag par khade kiye gaye","translations":{"ur":"جب وہ آگ پر کھڑے کیے گئے","en":"When they are made to stand before the Fire","hi":"जब वे आग पर खड़े किए गए"},"ref":"6:27"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"فَبَاءُوا بِغَضَبٍ عَلَى غَضَبٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَبَاء</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">غَضَبٍ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَضَبٍ</span>","hinglish":"To woh gusse par gusse ke mustahiq hue","translations":{"ur":"تو وہ غصے پر غصے کے مستحق ہوئے","en":"So they returned with anger upon anger","hi":"तो वे ग़ुस्से पर ग़ुस्से के मुस्तहिक़ हुए"},"ref":"2:90"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"إِنَّكَ لَعَلَى هُدًى مُسْتَقِيمٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُدًى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُسْتَقِيمٍ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak aap yaqeenan seedhi hidayat par hain","translations":{"ur":"بیشک آپ یقیناً سیدھی ہدایت پر ہیں","en":"Indeed, you are upon straight guidance","hi":"बेशक आप यक़ीनन सीधी हिदायत पर हैं"},"ref":"22:67"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"لَيْسَتِ النَّصَارَى عَلَى شَيْءٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">يْسَتِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّصَارَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيْءٍ</span>","hinglish":"Eesai kisi cheez par nahi hain","translations":{"ur":"عیسائی کسی چیز پر نہیں ہیں","en":"The Christians have nothing to stand on","hi":"ईसाई किसी चीज़ पर नहीं हैं"},"ref":"2:113"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"وَإِنَّكَ لَعَلَى خُلُقٍ عَظِيمٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِنَّكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خُلُقٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَظِيمٍ</span>","hinglish":"Aur beshak aap yaqeenan aala ikhlaq par hain","translations":{"en":"And indeed, you are of a great moral character","ur":"اور بیشک آپ یقیناً عظیم اخلاق کے حامل ہیں","hi":"और बेशक आप यक़ीनन अज़ीम अख़लाक़ पर हैं"},"ref":"68:4"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"فَمَا أَصْبَرَهُمْ عَلَى النَّارِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَمَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَصْبَر</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َهُمْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّارِ</span>","hinglish":"To kitna ziada sabr karne wale hain woh aag par!","translations":{"ur":"تو کتنا زیادہ صبر کرنے والے ہیں وہ آگ پر!","en":"So how patient are they for the Fire!","hi":"तो कितना ज़्यादा सब्र करने वाले हैं वे आग पर!"},"ref":"2:175"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"وَعَلَى الْوَارِثِ مِثْلُ ذَلِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَعَلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">وَارِثِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِثْلُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">ذَلِكَ</span>","hinglish":"Aur waaris par bhi is jaisa hai","translations":{"ur":"اور وارث پر بھی اس جیسا ہے","en":"And upon the heir is a duty like that","hi":"और वारिस पर भी इस जैसा है"},"ref":"2:233"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللَّهَ لَذُو فَضْلٍ عَلَى النَّاسِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ اللَّهَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَذُو فَضْلٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلَى النَّاسِ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah logon par bada fazl karne wala hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Allah is full of bounty to the people.","ur":"بیشک اللہ یقیناً لوگوں پر بڑا فضل فرمانے والا ہے۔","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह यक़ीनन लोगों पर बड़ा फ़ज़्ल (कृपा) करने वाला है।"},"ref":"2:243"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"وَكَانَ ذَلِكَ عَلَى اللَّهِ يَسِيرًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَكَانَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">ذَلِكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَسِيرًا</span>","hinglish":"Aur yeh Allah par aasaan hai","translations":{"ur":"اور یہ اللہ پر آسان ہے","en":"And that is easy for Allah","hi":"और यह अल्लाह पर आसान है"},"ref":"4:30"},{"id":"s2l4_v16_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"أُولَئِكَ عَلَى هُدًى مِنْ رَبِّهِمْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أُولَئِكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُدًى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّهِمْ</span>","hinglish":"Woh log apne Rabb ki taraf se hidayat par hain","translations":{"ur":"وہ لوگ اپنے رب کی طرف سے ہدایت پر ہیں","en":"Those are upon guidance from their Lord","hi":"वे लोग अपने रब की तरफ़ से हिदायत पर हैं"},"ref":"2:5"}],"cols":3}},{"type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise Q-2 (Page 59): (الْ) ki maujoodgi ya adam-maujoodgi ka khayal rakhte hue darj zail murakkabaat ka tarjuma karein:","title":"Exercise Q-2 (Page 59)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"cols":3,"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l4_ex2_w1","arabic":"عَلَى الْإِثْمِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِثْمِ</span>","hinglish":"Gunah par","translations":{"en":"Upon sin","ur":"گناہ پر","hi":"गुनाह पर"},"displayOrder":1},{"id":"s2l4_ex2_w2","arabic":"عَلَىٰ هُدًى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُدًى</span>","hinglish":"Kisi hidayat par","translations":{"en":"Upon guidance","ur":"کسی ہدایت پر","hi":"किसी हिदायत पर"},"displayOrder":2},{"id":"s2l4_ex2_w3","arabic":"عَلَى الْقَرْيَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَرْيَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Basti par","translations":{"en":"Upon the city","ur":"بستی پر","hi":"बस्ती पर"},"displayOrder":3},{"id":"s2l4_ex2_w4","arabic":"عَلَىٰ قَوْمٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi qaum par","translations":{"en":"Upon a people","ur":"کسی قوم پر","hi":"किसी क़ौम पर"},"displayOrder":4},{"id":"s2l4_ex2_w5","arabic":"عَلَى الْغَيْبِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْغَيْبِ</span>","hinglish":"Ghaib par","translations":{"en":"Over the unseen","ur":"غیب پر","hi":"ग़ैब पर"},"displayOrder":5},{"id":"s2l4_ex2_w6","arabic":"عَلَىٰ حَيَاةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَىٰ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَيَاةٍ</span>","hinglish":"Kisi zindagi par","transla